@startuml "Chain of Responsibility - Help (Parent) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Help through the parent field — GoF implementation issue 1, "use existing links"
class Widget {
  - parent : Widget
  - name : String
  - topic : String
  + path() : String
  + handleHelp() : String
}
Widget --> "0..1" Widget : parent
note right of Widget
  <b>path()</b> follows parent to say where the widget is.
  <b>handleHelp()</b> follows the same parent to pass help on.
end note
@enduml
